{"timestamp":"2026-08-27T09:24:01.668Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a04288-9204-77f1-acd3-a30475a1451c","call_id":"call_7wrKqwCSvWFY85iCb05vfYf1","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.1 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"import torch\nfrom tiered_serve.dual_memory_loader.base import *  # noqa: F401,F403\n\n\n# Per-codec prefill-alt chunk thresholds: the crossover N* below which the\n# alt-decode path (H2D compressed exp + reconstruct) beats the raw_bf16 fast\n# path (H2D 2*M*K, no kernel).  N* = (T_h2d_raw - T_dec) / t_gemm_per_token,\n# and ONLY T_dec (the codec's full-weight reconstruct cost) is codec-dependent:\n# a cheap branchless palette decode (p4flat) crosses over at a large chunk,\n# while a heavy ANS decode (dietgpu) crosses over at a much smaller one.\n# (zipserv is triple-bitmap exponent coding, NOT ANS; under frozen_split its\n# exp-only decode is cheap too, so it crosses over late — see the table below.)\n# Measure T_decomp per codec with benchmarks/weight_compress.py on an idle GPU\n# (its d_ms decompress-latency column, summed over the qkv/o/gateup/down fused\n# weights), feed it through the slack model above, and paste the result here.\n# Codecs absent from this dict fall back to\n# _PREFILL_ALT_MAX_CHUNK_GLOBAL_DEFAULT (= prior single-threshold behaviour).\n# The env var TIERED_SERVE_PREFILL_ALT_MAX_CHUNK overrides both: a single int\n# forces one global threshold; \"<codec>=<n>,...\" sets per-codec values.\n_PREFILL_ALT_MAX_CHUNK_GLOBAL_DEFAULT = 1330\n# Threshold = (T_load_raw_bf16 - T_decomp) / T_gemm_per_token, i.e. how many\n# tokens of GEMM fit in the slack the raw-H2D path has over the decode path.\n# This is CONFIG-AGGREGATE, not per-weight: T_load_raw and T_decomp depend on\n# the residency layout, so the SAME codec has different thresholds in different\n# configs. The values here are for the frozen_split configs (cao family);\n# offload_compressed configs use _OFFLOAD_PREFILL_MAX_CHUNK_DEFAULTS.\n#\n# Two effects make frozen_split (e.g. cao) carry a HIGH threshold:\n#   * frozen_split decode is EXP-ONLY (sm stays HBM) — far cheaper than the\n#     offload full-blob decompress, so T_decomp is small.\n#   * with all layers frozen_split, every layer loads raw (large T_load_raw).\n#   => big slack => large threshold.\n#   codec      thr    source\n#   p4flat     1330   hand-calibrated 400ms cao-p4flat operating point\n#                     (exp-only decomp 72 / load_raw 364 -> slack 292).\n#   zipserv    1107   cao slack model: load_raw 364 / exp-only decomp 121 ->\n#                     slack 243 -> 1330*243/292 = ~1107. zipserv's triple-\n#                     bitmap exp decode is HEAVIER than p4flat's palette\n#                     (121 vs 72ms), so it crosses over to raw_bf16 earlier.\n#   ublb_flat  1367   } synthetic isolated bench (palette/data-independent);\n#   p4d16      1206   } refine with the slack model if used under a real config.\n#   dietgpu     670   STALE synthetic. ANS+data-dependent — re-derive.\n_PREFILL_ALT_MAX_CHUNK_DEFAULTS = {\n    \"p4flat\": 1330,\n    \"ublb_flat\": 1367,\n    \"p4d16\": 1206,\n    \"zipserv\": 1107,   # cao (frozen_split): slack 243 (decomp 121) -> ~1107\n    \"dietgpu\": 670,    # TODO: re-derive with the slack model on a real config\n}\n\n# Codecs whose decompress is BIT-EXACT w.r.t. the original BF16 weight, so\n# decoding them during prefill is lossless. FP8 cells (zipserv_fp8, dietgpu_fp8,\n# p3flat_fp8) quantize, so offload_compressed prefill must keep their\n# uncompressed copy (see the \"for accuracy\" branch in _get_weight_source).\n_LOSSLESS_OFFLOAD_CODECS = frozenset({\n    \"zipserv\", \"dietgpu\", \"zipserv_bf16\", \"dietgpu_bf16\",\n    \"p4flat\", \"p4d16\", \"ublb_flat\",\n})\n\n# Phase-adaptive prefill for offload_compressed weights (see _get_weight_source).\n# offload_compressed already keeps BOTH a compressed and an uncompressed LPDDR\n# copy; today prefill ALWAYS H2Ds the uncompressed one (no chunk gating). Below\n# this per-codec chunk threshold, prefill instead H2Ds + FULL-decompresses the\n# compressed copy. Same slack model as the frozen_split knob\n# (thr = (T_load_raw - T_decomp)/T_gemm_per_token) but with DISTINCT inputs:\n# offload does the FULL-blob decompress (vs frozen_split's cheap exp-only), so\n# T_decomp is much larger, AND offload configs (e.g. flexgen-comp) typically\n# keep half the layers frozen_uncompressed, so fewer layers load -> smaller\n# T_load_raw. Both shrink the slack -> a MUCH lower threshold than frozen_split.\n#   codec    thr   source\n#   zipserv  384   flexgen-comp slack model: load_raw 182 / full decomp 109 ->\n#                  slack 73 -> 384 (vs cao's 1330 — same codec, different config).\n# Codecs without an entry resolve to 0 (disabled = always-uncompressed prefill,\n# i.e. unchanged behaviour). Per-config; override via\n# TIERED_SERVE_OFFLOAD_PREFILL_MAX_CHUNK (same \"<codec>=<n>,...|<int>\" syntax).\n_OFFLOAD_PREFILL_MAX_CHUNK_DEFAULTS = {\n    \"zipserv\": 384,   # flexgen-comp (offload, full decompress -> small slack)\n}\n\n_ENV_FROZEN_DETAILED_NVTX = (\n    os.getenv(\"TIERED_SERVE_FROZEN_DETAILED_NVTX\", \"0\") == \"1\")\n_ENV_WLOAD_GRAPH = os.getenv(\"TIERED_SERVE_WLOAD_GRAPH\", \"0\") == \"1\"\n_ENV_WLOAD_GRAPH_SEPARATE = (\n    os.getenv(\"TIERED_SERVE_WLOAD_GRAPH_SEPARATE\", \"0\") == \"1\")\n_ENV_ANY_WLOAD_GRAPH = _ENV_WLOAD_GRAPH or _ENV_WLOAD_GRAPH_SEPARATE\n            dietgpu_attrs = (\n                (\"raw_exp\",)\n                if (os.getenv(\"TIERED_SERVE_FROZEN_RAW_EXP\", \"0\") == \"1\"\n                    and comped.raw_exp is not None)\n                else SplitStorageInfo._DIETGPU_LPDDR_ATTRS)\n            return (\"dietgpu\",\n                    dietgpu_attrs,\n                    {\"exp_compressed_size\": comped.exp_compressed_size,\n                     \"M\": comped.M, \"K\": comped.K})\n        if isinstance(comped, CompressedDietGPUFP8Tensor):\n            return (\"dietgpu_fp8\",\n                    SplitStorageInfo._DIETGPU_FP8_LPDDR_ATTRS,\n                    {\"exp_compressed_size\": comped.exp_compressed_size,\n                     \"M\": comped.M, \"K\": comped.K,\n                     \"fp8_kind\": comped.fp8_kind,\n                     \"sm_nibble_packed\": comped.sm_nibble_packed,\n                     \"exp_nibble_packed\": comped.exp_nibble_packed})\n        if isinstance(comped, CompressedZipServFP8GpuTensor):\n            c = comped._c\n            return (\"zipserv_fp8\",\n                    SplitStorageInfo._ZIPSERV_FP8_LPDDR_ATTRS,\n                    {\"M\": int(c.M), \"K\": int(c.K),\n                     \"total_high_freq\": int(c.total_high_freq),\n                     \"total_full\": int(c.total_full),\n                     \"start_exp\": int(c.start_exp),\n                     \"num_bitmaps\": int(c.num_bitmaps),\n                     \"num_tiles\": int(c.num_tiles),\n                     \"num_groups\": int(c.num_groups),\n                     \"fp8_kind\": comped.fp8_kind})\n        if isinstance(comped, CompressedP4FlatTensor):\n            return (\"p4flat\",\n                    SplitStorageInfo._P4FLAT_LPDDR_ATTRS,\n                    {\"M\": int(comped.M), \"K\": int(comped.K),\n                     \"num_exceptions\": int(comped.num_exceptions),\n                     \"num_groups\": int(comped.num_groups)})\n        if isinstance(comped, CompressedUBLBFlatTensor):\n            return (\"ublb_flat\",\n                    SplitStorageInfo._UBLB_FLAT_LPDDR_ATTRS,\n                    {\"M\": int(comped.M), \"K\": int(comped.K),\n                     \"num_exceptions\": int(comped.exc_idx.numel())})\n        if isinstance(comped, CompressedP4D16Tensor):\n            return (\"p4d16\",\n                    SplitStorageInfo._P4D16_LPDDR_ATTRS,\n                    {\"M\": int(comped.M), \"K\": int(comped.K),\n                     \"num_exceptions\": int(comped.num_exceptions)})\n        if isinstance(comped, CompressedP3FlatFP8Tensor):\n            return (\"p3flat_fp8\",\n                    SplitStorageInfo._P3FLAT_FP8_LPDDR_ATTRS,\n                    {\"M\": int(comped.M), \"K\": int(comped.K),\n                     \"num_exceptions\": int(comped.num_exceptions)})\n        # Default: ZipServ BF16\n        return (\"zipserv\",\n                SplitStorageInfo._ZIPSERV_LPDDR_ATTRS,\n                {\"max_high_freq_count\": comped.max_high_freq_count,\n                 \"max_full_count\": comped.max_full_count,\n                 \"start_exp\": comped.start_exp,\n                 \"M\": comped.M, \"K\": comped.K})\n\n    def _build_frozen_split_hbm_bufs(self, src_obj, hbm_attrs\n                                     ) -> Dict[str, torch.Tensor]:\n        \"\"\"Clone the backend's HBM-resident auxiliary buffers (e.g.\n        ZipServ ``tile_offsets_*``) onto the primary device.\n\n        ``src_obj`` may expose these on GPU or host/LPDDR depending on the\n        codec caller.  In both cases the result is a freshly-owned GPU tensor\n        so SplitStorageInfo owns its HBM lifetime independently.\"\"\"\n        bufs: Dict[str, torch.Tensor] = {}\n        for attr in hbm_attrs:\n            t = getattr(src_obj, attr).contiguous()\n            if t.is_cuda:\n                bufs[attr] = t.clone()\n            else:\n                bufs[attr] = t.to(self.primary_device, non_blocking=False)\n        return bufs\n\n    def _compress_to_frozen_split(self, idx: int, name: str,\n                                  gpu_src: torch.Tensor,\n                                  leaf_module, tensor_name: str):\n        \"\"\"Compress ``gpu_src`` into frozen_split storage.\n\n        Mirrors the init-path frozen_split branch\n        (_init_weights_per_layer line ~1509-1678):\n          - sign+mantissa stays on HBM (cloned)\n          - raw_bf16 + backend-specific aux buffers ship to LPDDR\n          - module param is repointed at the parity-specific primary\n            buffer (where _decompress_frozen_split_for_name will write).\n\n        Caller is responsible for clearing DRAM secondary buffers.\n        Returns the freshly-built SplitStorageInfo.\n        \"\"\"\n        self._ensure_frozen_split_prereqs()\n        self._ensure_frozen_primary_buffer(name)\n        parity = idx % self.FROZEN_DECOMP_PARITY\n        primary = self.frozen_primary_buffer_pair[name][parity]\n        compressor = self._compressor_split\n\n        with torch.cuda.stream(self.decomp_weight_stream):\n            if gpu_src.data_ptr() != primary.data_ptr():\n                primary.copy_(gpu_src, non_blocking=False)\n            if self._frozen_raw_exp:\n                comped = RawExpCompressed.from_weight(primary)\n            else:\n                comped = compressor.compress(primary, primary)\n            torch.cuda.synchronize()\n\n        if isinstance(comped, CompressedP3FlatFP8Tensor):\n            hbm_sm = comped.sm_nibbles.clone()\n        elif isinstance(comped, CompressedUBLBFlatTensor):\n            hbm_sm = comped.lb_raw.clone()\n        else:\n            sm_src = (comped._c\n                      if isinstance(comped, CompressedZipServFP8GpuTensor)\n                      else comped)\n            hbm_sm = sm_src.sign_mantissa.clone()\n\n        backend, lpddr_attrs, metadata = self._frozen_split_backend_meta(comped)\n\n        src_obj = (comped._c if backend == \"zipserv_fp8\" else comped)\n        lpddr_bufs: Dict[str, torch.Tensor] = {}\n        for attr in tuple(lpddr_attrs) + (\"raw_bf16\",):\n            if attr == \"raw_bf16\":\n                gpu_buf = gpu_src\n            else:\n                gpu_buf = getattr(src_obj, attr)\n                if (backend in (\"dietgpu\", \"dietgpu_fp8\")\n                        and attr == \"compressed_exp\"):\n                    gpu_buf = gpu_buf[:comped.exp_compressed_size]\n            gpu_buf = gpu_buf.contiguous()\n            hp_t = self.huge_page_alloc